<title>PHILIPPINES: Digitel Q1 net rises 108 pct.</title>
<headline>Digitel Q1 net rises 108 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>			 (in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Operating revenues	    375.8 vs 218.5</p>
<p>    Net income			240.2 vs 115.4</p>
<p>Note: Full name Digital Telecommunications Phils Inc (Digitel). The company attributed the growth to higher international call traffic and increased interconnection agreements with local carriers.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
